# label | keys | help key | on or off

always
  quit | ctrl+c | ^c | on
  help | ? | ? | off

Merge (types)
  merge | ctrl+s | ^s | on
  cancel | esc | esc | on
  editor | ctrl+e | ^e | off
  next field | tab | tab | on
  previous field | shift+tab | shift+tab | on
  previous method | left | ← | on
  next method | right | → | on
